### Duplicate an estimate

POST {{baseUrl}}/estimate/duplicate/69fb010d1a74edd18fe057e8 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{estMir}}
Content-Type: application/json


### Create a client with both billing and service address

POST {{baseUrl}}/estimate/create-client HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{estMir}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "123 Main Street",
  "city": "Springfield",
  "clientName": "Acme Construction",
  "email": "billing@acme.com",
  "isServiceDifferent": true,
  "phoneNumber": "555-123-4567",
  "serviceAddress": "456 Elm Street",
  "serviceCity": "Shelbyville",
  "serviceState": "IL",
  "serviceZip": "62565",
  "state": "IL",
  "zip": "62701"
}
